{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_35741","headline":"送人 · 李咸用","name":"送人","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"少皥开宫行帝业，无刃金风剪红叶。\n雁别边沙入暖云，蛩辞败草鸣香合。\n有客爲儒二十霜，酣歌郢雪时飘扬。\n不甘长在诸生下，束书携劒离家乡。\n利爪韝上鹰，雄文雾中豹。\n可堪长与乌鸢噪，是宜摩碧汉以遐飞。\n出南山而远蹈，况今大朝公道。\n天子文明，团团月树悬青青。\n燕中有马如龙行，不换黄金无骏名。\n荆山有玉犹在璞，未遇良工虚掷鹊。\n一壶清酒酌离情，休向嵩中随雀跃。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李咸用","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_35741.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_35741","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}